nche-county"],["ARC or PLC in Comanche County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/comanche-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. In 2025 the middle ran 22% of normal in January to February 2025 and 298% in March to April 2025. In 2026 so far, February to March 2026 came in at 35% on the middle. Grid 17825 had its driest year in 1954 at 53%, and the other listed grids had theirs in 2011.</p>"}
